OL,3,AWhat we know so far about Jensen
OL,4,AHuang's affair with suspected Chinese
OL,5,Aspy
OL,6,
OL,7,FOne of the Artificial Intelligence (AI)
OL,8,Findustry's most important figures has
OL,9,Fbeen accused of having an affair with a
OL,10,Fsuspected Chinese spy.
OL,12,FUS intelligence officials believed that
OL,13,FChinese businesswoman Alice Huang, who
OL,14,Fhad a close relationship with Nvidia
OL,15,FCEO and co-founder Jensen Huang, was a
OL,16,Fspy for Beijing, according to a New
OL,17,FYork Times report.
OL,19,FJensen Huang admitted to having been
OL,20,F"unfaithful" to his wife and apologised
OL,21,Ffor hurting her and their children.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/19
