OL,3,A'Baffling but brilliant'
OL,4,Apost-apocalyptic novel The End of
OL,5,AEverything wins Booker Prize
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe End of Everything is set in the
OL,8,Fyears after a mysterious catastrophe
OL,9,Fthat caused British society as we know
OL,10,Fit to collapse. It has divided opinion
OL,11,Famong readers, and was described as
OL,12,F"bleak but brilliant" and "dreamlike
OL,13,Fand baffling" by one critic.
OL,15,FDame Mary Beard, who chaired the Booker
OL,16,Fjudges, said: "It's a challenging read,
OL,17,Fbut some of the best fiction is
OL,18,Fchallenging."
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG15/19
